---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#-
  Two-column layout with TopicNav on the left (HANDOFF §5, §6.4; board
  Problem-A.dc.html), used by problem pages (layouts/problem.njk). Below
  600px the sidebar is hidden and TopicNav is reached through the Menu panel
  instead.

  <main> is the right-hand column, so the skip link jumps past TopicNav.
  Start here has its own layout (layouts/start.njk): a title band with its
  chapter pills above both columns, all inside <main>.

  Front matter (plus everything base.njk reads):
    area      the current problem's area_id: opens it in TopicNav
-#}
{%- from "partials/topic-nav.njk" import topicNav -%}
{%- set topicAreas = collections.problems | groupByArea(areas) -%}
{%- set navChapters = chapters | introChapters(collections.videos) -%}
<div class="with-sidebar container">
  <div class="with-sidebar__side">
    {{ topicNav(topicAreas, page_id, area, navChapters, 's-', page.url) }}
  </div>
  <main id="main" class="with-sidebar__main">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>
</div>
